WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.915
A decision-maker needs a brief not a pile of

00:00:02.915 --> 00:00:07.902
forwarded messages Bring the earlier facts role boundaries and

00:00:07.955 --> 00:00:12.297
options together in your first decision brief Forwarding every

00:00:12.323 --> 00:00:15.336
message may leave the executive to reconstruct the whole

00:00:15.402 --> 00:00:22.126
problem We will organise the request constraints alternatives recommendation

00:00:22.534 --> 00:00:25.915
decisions and unknowns into a short usable brief
